  "description": "In this life, I will rule the battlefield. Damian, a captain in the Baroque Kingdom’s Punishment Corps. \n\n*“Damn it Just once. If only I were given one more chance… I really would have ruled the battlefield alongside these guys.'*\n\nAt the age of 30, I closed my eyes on an anonymous battlefield. But when I opened my eyes, I had returned to 17 years ago. And not just that, I possessed a fully functional magic vein that allowed me to cultivate magic.\n\n*‘This time. I will rise higher than anyone else. I won’t be swept along by the era of war. I will be the one to rule.’*\n\nDamian, having returned to the past, swings his spear at the world.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
